Vehicle is drivable with derated performance when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltBatteryNegSevOverTempAnyBP "Set Condition: Battery Positive Severe Over Temperature Fault received from any of the BP.
Reset Condition: Battery Positive Severe Over Temperature Fault received from none of the BP.

Vehicle is drivable with derated performance when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltDIUMOSFETSevOverTemp "Set Condition: DIU MOSFET Temperature >= DIU MOSFET Severe Over Temperature Threshold.
Reset Condition: Key Toggle and DIU MOSFET Temperature < DIU MOSFET Severe Over Temperature Threshold.

Vehicle not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltDIUMOSFETOverTemp "Set Condition: DIU MOSFET Temperature >= DIU MOSFET Over Temperature Threshold.
Reset Condition:DIU MOSFET Temperature < DIU MOSFET Over Temperature Threshold.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltPackPosSevOverTempAllBP "Set Condition: Pack Positive Severe  Over Temperature Fault received from all BPs.
Reset Condition: Pack Positve Severe Over Temperature Fault not received from any of the BPs.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
