CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltBatteryPosOverTemp "Set Condition: Battery Positive Over Temperature Fault received from any of the BP.
Reset Condition: Battery Positive Over Temperature Fault received from none of the BP.

Vehicle is drivable with derated performance when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltAllChargeFlagsNotSet "Set Condition: 
1. Charge Flag is not set in the BP.
2. Vehicle is inserted with already Driven BPs.

Reset Condition:
1. Turn Off the Key.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltBPSerialNoMismatch "Set condition: Inserted BPs serial Number not maching with stored Serial Numbers (Fault will be set iin Key ON Condition).
Reset condition: Turn Off the Key.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltBPIDStatusNotReceived "Set Condition: 
1. Partial communication between BPs and DIU during Key ON.

Reset Condition:
1. Turn off the Key.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltErroneousDriveStatusRcvd "Set Condition:
1. Drive status Not configured from the station during dispense.
Reset Condition: Key Off.

Vehicle is not Drivable when Fault is set.


";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltMultipleDriveEnStatusRcvd "Set Condition: More than one BP configured with Drive Enable status during dispense (Fault will be set in Key ON).
Reset Condition: Key Toogle.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltNoBPWithDriveEnable "Set Condition: All BPs are configured with Drive Disable status during dispense from station(Fault will be set in Key ON).
Reset Condition: Key Off.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltTargetDOCKIDNotReceived "Set Condition: Partial Communication between Batteries and DIU during Key ON.
Reset Condition: Key Off.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltTargetDOCKIDMismatch "Set Condition: 
BP from other Vehicle is inserted or BPs are swapped by using different Key Fob and inserted to the Vehicle (Fault will be set in Key ON).
Reset Condition: Key Off.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltEVOUTSenseMalfunction "Set Condition: EVOUTSENSE > 18V, before turing ON the DIU MOSFET.
Reset Conditon: Key Toggle and Correct the wiring.

Vehicle is not driveable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltVCUCommunicationFailure "Set Condition: Key is ON and VCU is not communicating for more than 2 sec.
Reset Condtion: Key Off or Key is ON and VCU Communication is restored.

Applicable only for VCU Vehicles.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltKeyAlreadyON "Set Condition:First Battery inserted in the vehicle in Key ON Condition.
Reset Condition: Key Toggle.

Vehicle is not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 SigFltThermalRunawayWarning "Set Condition: Thermal Runway Warning received from any BP.
Reset Condition: Clear Fault using Diagnostics.

Vehicle is  not drivable when Fault is set.
";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 SigFltOverCurrentAllBP "Set Condition: Over Current Fault received from all BPs.
