Vehicle is drivable with derated performance when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltMCUCommunicationFault "Set Condition: MCU is not communicating for more than 2 secs, when 48V output is present from the DIU.
Reset Condition: Key Off or MCU communication is restored.

Applicable only for MCU Vehicles";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltEVInSenseMalfunction "Set Condition: EVINSENSE >= 18V for 5 sec before turing ON the Key.(Battery MOSFET Short)
Reset Condtion: Key Off and EVINSENSE < 18V for 5 sec. 

Vehicle not drivable when Fault is set.";
CM_ SG_ 2419654480 sigFltPermDckNegTerminalTemp "Set Condition: Severe DOCK NegativeTempFault in any of the BP in 3 cycles out of last 10 Swap cycles.
